@page "/mcp-server"

@* Describes the MCP server this demo's host maps at /mcp. Its route differs from the endpoint's on
   purpose: two literal endpoints on /mcp would make a GET of it ambiguous. *@

<PageTitle>MCP server - bit Bcrdt</PageTitle>

<h1>MCP server</h1>

<section class="prose">
    <p>
        This site hosts a Model Context Protocol server at <code>/mcp</code>, so an AI agent adding collaboration
        with Bit.Bcrdt reads the library itself - the compiled API documentation of its four packages, its guide,
        its real CRDT engine and decoders, and these demo pages - instead of guessing at an API it half remembers,
        or at what a merge will decide. Every tool is read-only.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="prose">
    <h2>Connect a client</h2>

    <p>
        The endpoint is plain Streamable HTTP, so any MCP client connects with a URL and nothing else:
        <code>https://bcrdt.bitplatform.dev/mcp</code>, or <code>http://localhost:5560/mcp</code> while the demo runs
        locally. The same tools are also served, version by version, through the bit platform's own server at
        <code>https://bitplatform.dev/mcp</code>, next to the other bit libraries.
    </p>

    <pre class="code"><code>@ClientConfig</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="prose">
    <h2>Tools</h2>

    <table class="log-table">
        <thead>
            <tr><th>Tool</th><th>What it answers</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><code>SearchBcrdt</code></td>
                <td>Everything at once - the guide, every public member of the four packages, the setup guides and the demo sources - each hit with the exact follow-up call.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>GetBcrdtSetupGuide</code></td>
                <td>The complete wiring for one hosting model - web-app, standalone-wasm, server, hybrid, websocket or console - or the index of them.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>GetBcrdtGuideSection</code></td>
                <td>One section of the reference guide, or the index of sections.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>GetBcrdtApi</code></td>
                <td>One public type with its constructors, parameters, properties and methods, their real defaults and their documentation - or the index of types.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>InspectBcrdtMerge</code></td>
                <td>Runs the real engine on concurrent edits by two to four replicas and reports each one's state before the merge, what they converge to, every update's size, and what was decided - one value wins for a map key, both survive in a text.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>InspectBcrdtUpdate</code></td>
                <td>Decodes an update or a protocol message - its kind, the blocks per client, the delete set, the state vector it implies and its sizes - or says why the library rejects it.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>GetBcrdtSourceFile</code></td>
                <td>One demo file verbatim - every page here is a set of real replicas merging for real - or the index of files.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>
        The guide, the API, the setup guides and the sources are also exposed as <code>bcrdt://</code> resources, and
        three prompts - <code>add-bcrdt-to-app</code>, <code>implement-bcrdt-feature</code> and
        <code>debug-bcrdt-sync</code> - walk an agent through the common jobs in the right order.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="prose">
    <h2>The same tools over plain HTTP</h2>

    <p>
        Every tool is also a <code>GET</code> under <code>/api/mcp/...</code>: open one in a browser tab to read
        exactly what an agent is handed.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/SearchBcrdt?query=concurrent%20map%20writes" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/SearchBcrdt?query=concurrent map writes</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBcrdtSetupGuide?hostingModel=server" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBcrdtSetupGuide?hostingModel=server</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBcrdtApi?typeName=BcrdtCollaborativeDocument" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBcrdtApi?typeName=BcrdtCollaborativeDocument</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/InspectBcrdtMerge" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/InspectBcrdtMerge</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/InspectBcrdtUpdate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/InspectBcrdtUpdate</a></li>
        <li><a href="/api/mcp/GetBcrdtSourceFile?path=Demo/Client/Pages/Live.razor" target="_blank" rel="noopener">/api/mcp/GetBcrdtSourceFile?path=Demo/Client/Pages/Live.razor</a></li>
    </ul>
</section>

